    "Title": "IAM.5 MFA should be enabled for all IAM users that have a console password",
    "Description": "This control checks whether AWS multi-factor authentication (MFA) is enabled for all IAM users that have a console password. MFA adds an extra layer of protection on top of a username and password. With MFA enabled, when a user signs in to an AWS website, they are prompted for their username and password and also for an authentication code from their device.",
